<!--
  Material Icons (Rounded) "stay_current_landscape", Apache-2.0.

  24-unit viewBox rather than the 960 of the other icons in this directory: those
  come from Material Symbols, this one from Material Icons, and Media3's own
  controller icons are the latter too — so its proportions match the buttons it
  sits among better than a Symbols glyph would. No translate group is needed, as
  this viewBox already starts at zero.

  Filled white, not tinted, for the same reason as `ic_tune`: the reader is
  Media3's `ImageButton`, whose style carries no `android:tint` at all.

  Shown when the picture is portrait, i.e. it names where the button will take
  you rather than where you are.
-->
